abstract: >-
  CUSCOE is an operating model for professional and managed services
  organisations delivering AI as a service. It places a single governed
  Portfolio at the centre of the business, pools technical staff into
  competency-based Centres of Excellence, and gives Customer Success
  ownership of the customer after signature.
